<h1>Third-party licenses of the Python in libsmol</h1>
<p>libsmol runs code in a WebAssembly build of RustPython, which is made from the libraries below and from wasi-libc. Each license is listed with the libraries that use it.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
<li><a href="#wasi-libc">wasi-libc</a></li>
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
